OL,3,AAI staff 'genuinely frightened' for
OL,4,Ahumanity's future, ex-Anthropic
OL,5,Aresearcher tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis resignation comes amid growing
OL,8,Fsafety concerns in the industry,
OL,9,Fincluding from his former boss, head of
OL,10,FAnthropic Dario Amodei, who in an essay
OL,11,Fon Saturday argued for development to
OL,12,Fslow down.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
