OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been growing concerns
OL,7,Frecently about the technology's
OL,8,Fpotential risks. An AI researcher who
OL,9,Fleft Anthropic this week told the BBC
OL,10,Fthat "if we don't slow down at the
OL,11,Fcurrent rate of progress, there is a
OL,12,Fstrong chance that we could all die in
OL,13,Fthe immediate future".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
